                <pb facs="1614" n="1456" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1456"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-04-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell asks to be informed if he is to join his colleagues in note to the
                    Government, embodying the department’s views as stated in No. 35, of 2d of
                    April.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
